| Resource | Hourly Cost (Spot) | For 1 Hour Test |
|----------|-------------------|-----------------|
| T4 GPU | ~$0.35 | $0.35 |
| n1-standard-4 | ~$0.05 | $0.05 |
| GKE Management | ~$0.10 | $0.10 |
